{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>הרים</b> — R. Marinus said: ותשא הארץ (and the earth lifts up) [means] terror, like נשאתי אימיך אפונה. The correct view in my eyes: ותשא [means] a burden of burning, for the earth was burned, and likewise: וישאם דוד ואנשיו. And the meaning: and He burns them." "And the meaning is because he said at the beginning בעל חמה, who burns the earth in His wrath, in the manner of וחמתו בערה בו, and the witness."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "The citation נשאתי אימיך אפונה is obscure; possibly corrupt. Rendered hyper-literally without emendation."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:28.670533772Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}